<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle up $2-$3 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle up $2-$3 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was moderately active and compared to the previous week feeder steers and heifers sold mostly $2.00-$3.00 per cwt higher on a thin test, USDA said.</p>
<p>Bulk of advance on feeder heifers. Many consigments cancelled due to wet-mud related road conditions.</p>
